+Keep every inherited supported sensor. IMX558 1925's and IMX958 2224's magic
+and length are the apple_isp driver's setfile entries (Aurora's isp-cam.c and
+aurora-installer's asahi_firmware/isp.py carry the same values); other
+unqualified sensor IDs are not enabled merely because a byte pattern occurs in
+the daemon. The IMX958 is the camera of the MacBook Pro 16-inch with M4 Pro or
+M4 Max (J616s, J616c): without its setfile the driver streams untuned.
